  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0bf5dcc2-c17a-4701-a673-468515a74473"],
 " of two message functions"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"6a0def3e-dcab-4450-b5b5-931f06e2edcc"],

